</reply>

# Client-side. Expected output measured from real curl 8.22.0 (Schannel build) on Windows, 2026-10-25.
<client>
<server>
file
</server>
<name>
open-ended range -r 7- on a file:// URL returns the rest of the file
</name>
<command option="no-include">
-r 7- file://localhost%FILE_PWD/%LOGDIR/ext%TESTNUMBER.txt
</command>
<file name="%LOGDIR/ext%TESTNUMBER.txt">
1234567890
</file>
</client>

<verify>
<stdout>
890
</stdout>
</verify>
</testcase>
